AssetMoves {
    at    Source/DreamShaderEditor/Private/Commandlet/DreamShaderMigrate.cpp
    src   "'{0}' builds '{1}', and its migrated text would build '{2}': a new asset, with the old one left behind. Give the declaration a '/// @name {1}'."
    text  "'{0}' 构建的是 '{1}'，而迁移后的文本会构建 '{2}'：一个新资产，旧资产被留在原地。请给该声明加上 '/// @name {1}'。"
    state machine
}

CatalogEmpty {
